&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Queue transitions to out-of-operating hours&lt;/strong&gt;: The system continuously monitors active conversations that entered a queue before (GA: October CY2026) — Microsoft Copilot (Microsoft 365), Dynamics 365 Contact Center

[STATUS_CHANGED] &lt;p&gt;Discover easier ways to use Copilot in OneDrive&lt;br&gt;
The new Prompt Gallery offers ready-to-use prompts for common file tasks, helping you get started quickly, discover what Copilot can do, and customize prompts to fit your needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access the Prompt Gallery from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Copilot button in (GA: October CY2026) — OneDrive, Microsoft Copilot (Microsoft 365)

[STATUS_CHANGED] &lt;p&gt;We’re excited to announce two new Copilot skills in the SharePoint Admin Center:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Step-by-Step Task Guidance&lt;br&gt;
Copilot can now walk you through the exact steps required to complete common admin tasks.&lt;br&gt;
Example: “How can I find sites that are potentially over-permissioned?”&lt;br&gt; (GA: October CY2025) — SharePoint

[UPDATED] &lt;p&gt;The Adherence History Report provides a complete view of customer service representatives’ historical adherence to scheduled tasks and activities. It helps supervisors analyze patterns, identify gaps, and improve workforce efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trend  (GA: June CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Contact Center, Dynamics 365 Customer Service

&lt;p&gt;Real-time streaming analytics is built into the new supervisor application. An advanced streaming engine keeps metrics up to date with near-instant updates, allowing supervisors to view the latest data without refreshing the dashboard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key capabilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
